        ["In Gentile's taxonomy, which task is the MOST complex?", ["Walking while carrying a tray through a moving crowd", "Standing still on a firm floor in a quiet room", "Walking across an empty hallway without objects", "Sitting and reaching for a stationary cup"], "Body transport, object manipulation, and an environment in motion together make this the most demanding category."]
